{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|cōnifer|t=bearing cones}}, from {{m|la|cōnus|t=cone}} + {{m|la|ferō|t=to bear}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|botany}} A plant belonging to the [[conifers]]; a [[cone]]-bearing seed [[plant]] with [[vascular]] tissue, usually a [[tree]].

